WEBVTT

00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:37.760
Everyone!

00:00:37.990 --> 00:00:40.600
Thanks for coming to listen!

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:46.630
Kagetsu is so cute.

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:48.030
She sure is!

00:00:48.030 --> 00:00:49.520
I bet she'd be really attractive.

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:51.940
"Attractive"?

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:57.300
I'd like to take this chance to 
reintroduce the members of Team Rabbit!

00:00:57.300 --> 00:00:59.390
On the drum, Mukuge!

00:00:59.390 --> 00:01:00.880
Yay!

00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:04.500
What is "attractive"?

00:01:04.820 --> 00:01:09.380
Um, I guess it means 
"readily liked by lots of men."

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:13.270
On the flute, Hototogisu!

00:01:14.600 --> 00:01:15.800
Thank you.

00:01:15.960 --> 00:01:17.980
<i>Readily liked by men.</i>

00:01:17.980 --> 00:01:21.010
<i>Th-There </i>is<i> such a thing?</i>

00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:22.090
<i>To be attractive?</i>

00:01:23.020 --> 00:01:25.300
And on vocals, me!

00:01:25.300 --> 00:01:27.230
Kagetsu!

00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:34.680
The song we're debuting 
here today is brand new!

00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:37.980
I'll sing as best I can, 
so listen all the way through!

00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:43.060
Kagetsu worried herself sick writing it!

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:46.940
We'll play the best we can, too.

00:01:46.940 --> 00:01:47.710
Yeah!

00:01:49.490 --> 00:01:51.570
Okay, here goes!

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:04.520
Uh...

00:02:05.190 --> 00:02:07.140
How do you go about being attractive?

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:10.240
Rindou?

00:02:11.310 --> 00:02:12.560
Oh, sorry.

00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:14.230
Can we finish listening first?

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:16.990
Oh, o-of course!

00:02:17.440 --> 00:02:22.270
<i>I want to know, right now. 
What does being attractive entail?!</i>

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:57.630
<b>Attractiveness Jutsu</b>

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:58.470
Rindou.

00:03:59.930 --> 00:04:02.760
What does it take to be attractive?!

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:06.100
Um...

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.930
Is it something you're 
born with, like talent?

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:11.960
Or can it be mastered, like a Jutsu?

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:16.740
I think it's both talent, 
as well as something you can learn.

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:21.130
Do you want to be attractive, Tsubaki?

00:04:21.980 --> 00:04:22.990
No!

00:04:22.990 --> 00:04:26.850
Uh... I guess you'd say I'm curious.

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:27.700
That is...

00:04:29.230 --> 00:04:29.940
Yes.

00:04:29.940 --> 00:04:30.870
Oh, yeah?

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:35.280
And so, please teach me 
what attractiveness is!

00:04:34.190 --> 00:04:35.280
Attractiveness?

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:37.840
Stare...

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:40.560
Uh, well, that is...

00:04:40.560 --> 00:04:43.860
"Attractiveness" means being liked by men.

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:44.930
Rindou!

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:47.530
Liked?

00:04:48.460 --> 00:04:49.890
By men?

00:04:49.890 --> 00:04:52.410
No... This is just...

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:54.140
I get it.

00:04:54.320 --> 00:04:58.650
You make him like you, then defeat 
him when his guard is down!

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:00.740
Th-That's right!

00:05:00.740 --> 00:05:04.650
It's called Attractiveness Jutsu, and I 
was just about to learn it from Rindou!

00:05:04.650 --> 00:05:05.480
Right, Rindou?

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:06.990
That's right.

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:08.680
Wow! Attractiveness Jutsu!

00:05:08.680 --> 00:05:10.210
Sounds like fun!

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:12.380
I want to do it, too, Nee-sama!

00:05:12.380 --> 00:05:13.920
So do I!

00:05:14.670 --> 00:05:17.670
<b>Attractiveness Jutsu Course</b>

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:21.550
Um. Well, let's begin the 
Attractiveness Jutsu Course.

00:05:21.550 --> 00:05:23.380
Hurry and teach us!

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:25.600
Let's be sure to master it, Nee-sama!

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:27.430
Y-Yes.

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:29.560
So, what do you do?

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:32.930
Um, well...

00:05:33.960 --> 00:05:37.250
Actually, I don't really 
understand it well myself.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:42.820
I can look and tell if someone's likely to 
be attractive, but it's hard to explain.

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:45.050
Well, <i>that's</i> vague.

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:46.280
Sorry.

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:49.650
You looked at Kagetsu, 
and said she could be attractive.

00:05:49.650 --> 00:05:52.000
Who else do you think could be attractive?

00:05:52.330 --> 00:05:54.210
People who could be attractive?

00:05:54.210 --> 00:05:57.840
If we know what they have in common, 
that might provide some clue.

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:04.380
Mokuren, and Benisumomo.

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:05.920
Also...

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:09.360
you, too, Tsubaki.

00:06:09.360 --> 00:06:10.390
Huh?

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:12.210
I-Is that so?

00:06:12.210 --> 00:06:13.190
Yeah.

00:06:13.190 --> 00:06:16.870
That's my Nee-sama! 
A natural-born man-killer!

00:06:16.870 --> 00:06:18.920
Lucky you, man-killer.

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:21.020
<i>I-I'm thrilled!</i>

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:25.450
Mokuren, Benisumomo, Nee-sama.

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:29.020
What do these three have in common?

00:06:29.020 --> 00:06:32.150
Oh! Maybe that means team 
leaders are attractive!

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:34.750
I don't think that's it.

00:06:34.750 --> 00:06:37.330
Hey, hey. What about me, then?

00:06:37.690 --> 00:06:40.530
I think you're incredibly cute, Asagao,

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:43.060
but I'm not so sure about attractive.

00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:44.800
Then how do I be attractive?

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:47.260
Teach me Attractiveness Jutsu, Sensei!

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:49.600
"S-Sensei"...!

00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:52.880
Okay, come with me, then.

00:06:52.880 --> 00:06:53.810
Yes, ma'am!

00:06:55.980 --> 00:06:58.280
Take a seat. Do this with your hands.

00:06:58.280 --> 00:06:59.410
Like this?

00:06:59.410 --> 00:07:00.770
Yeah, that's good.

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:02.260
Now bring your legs together.

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:18.330
It was so delicious, I ate until I was full.

00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:20.830
<i>Adorable!</i>

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:23.410
I'm gonna be sick!

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:28.710
But I'll still have seconds. 
After all, I love rice so much.

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:32.440
That's cute, Asagao! 
Different from usual, somehow!

00:07:32.440 --> 00:07:34.950
No way! How do you figure, Nee-sama?!

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:37.230
Yeah. That was good, Asagao.

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:41.900
But I can't keep a straight 
face, it's so ridiculous.

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:45.740
That isn't true at all! You were very cute!

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:49.050
Rindou! Teach me, too!

00:07:49.050 --> 00:07:50.050
Sure.

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:03.650
My name is Sazanka. 
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:08:05.090 --> 00:08:07.450
<i>Eek! Extremely cute!</i>

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:09.050
Gross!

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:10.930
How was that, Nee-sama?

00:08:10.930 --> 00:08:13.170
It was cute, Sazanka!

00:08:13.170 --> 00:08:14.970
You have quite a knack for it.

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:16.730
Says you!

00:08:17.170 --> 00:08:18.530
Weird!

00:08:18.530 --> 00:08:21.270
It's true, I nearly laughed partway though.

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:22.800
I know, right?

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:24.050
Let's do it again!

00:08:24.050 --> 00:08:25.310
You got it!

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:28.740
<i>Wow...</i>

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:32.080
<i>Feels like my heart is racing.</i>

00:08:32.810 --> 00:08:34.060
Uh, Rindou!

00:08:34.060 --> 00:08:34.670
Huh?

00:08:34.670 --> 00:08:37.800
I'd like to do it, too, next time.

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:38.710
Okay.

00:08:39.210 --> 00:08:41.010
But, Tsubaki, huh?

00:08:41.010 --> 00:08:42.700
That's not easy.

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:45.330
I might not be able to teach you well.

00:08:45.330 --> 00:08:45.880
Huh?

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:49.880
Those two are always boisterous, 
so it's easy to give them advice.

00:08:50.280 --> 00:08:52.370
But you're not like that.

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:54.390
And you're cute in the first place.

00:08:55.450 --> 00:08:57.890
I-Is that the way it is?

00:08:57.890 --> 00:08:59.330
Here goes!

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:03.360
Would you care for a bite?

00:09:03.690 --> 00:09:06.850
Well, aren't you the sweetest thing?

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:12.260
Very good, you two! That was spot on!

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:15.680
So funny! It's like it's 
not even you, Sazanka!

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:17.190
<i>Wow... Have these two already mastered it?</i>

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:21.080
<i>And here, I don't understand it at all!</i>

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:21.080
S-Same goes for you, Asagao!

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:25.210
<i>In fact, I have a feeling I can't outdo them.</i>

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:30.350
<i>Could it be Rindou can tell I have 
no talent for attractiveness,</i>

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:32.010
<i>and she's lying to spare my feelings?!</i>

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:34.610
And you're cute in the first place.

00:09:34.610 --> 00:09:39.060
<i>Oh, that's it! That must have 
been her giving up on me!</i>

00:09:45.210 --> 00:09:46.070
<i>But...</i>

00:09:46.820 --> 00:09:48.390
<i><i>I</i> won't give up.</i>

00:09:49.030 --> 00:09:49.830
Next!

00:09:52.700 --> 00:09:55.830
It's my turn!

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:59.910
<i>Whatever it takes, I want 
to learn attractiveness!</i>

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:06.920
<i>If I analyze the things Sazanka 
and Asagao were doing,</i>

00:10:07.340 --> 00:10:10.310
<i>I'm sure I'll find my own 
Attractiveness Jutsu.</i>

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:14.960
<i>Got it.</i>

00:10:16.680 --> 00:10:17.930
Here I go!

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:32.810
The crane was so beautiful, 
I found myself imitating it.

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:43.660
What was that?!

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:46.050
You're too funny, Nee-sama!

00:10:46.050 --> 00:10:47.460
Why a crane?

00:10:47.460 --> 00:10:49.110
My belly hurts!

00:10:55.820 --> 00:10:57.260
Tsubaki-chan...

00:10:57.260 --> 00:10:59.000
Cheer up.

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:00.400
Nee-sama...

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:04.100
I guess I have no talent after all...

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:06.340
for Attractiveness Jutsu!

00:11:06.340 --> 00:11:09.360
No. Like I said, 
I think if you just be yourself—

00:11:09.360 --> 00:11:11.060
I want to understand it!

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:18.740
I want to understand 
Attractiveness Jutsu and fully master it!

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:23.270
I want to be more attractive!

00:11:27.130 --> 00:11:31.620
I hear that desperately wanting to be 
attractive makes you unattractive.

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:43.570
Wh-Why don't we... go and eat dinner?

00:11:52.230 --> 00:11:53.870
<i>Mustn't want to be attractive!</i>

00:11:53.870 --> 00:11:55.310
<i>Mustn't want to be attractive!</i>

00:11:55.310 --> 00:11:57.820
<i>Mustn't do it, and yet...!</i>

00:11:59.390 --> 00:12:01.280
Is something wrong with Tsubaki?

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:03.280
Um, well...

00:12:03.460 --> 00:12:06.750
<i>She wants to be attractive that badly.</i>

00:12:10.590 --> 00:12:14.260
<i>I-I want to be attractive!</i>

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:19.680
<b>I Want to Be Attractive</b>

00:12:19.520 --> 00:12:23.380
Well, Nee-sama. Let us proceed 
to the training grounds.

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:25.060
Yes, let us be off.

00:12:30.090 --> 00:12:33.080
<i>I want to get good at 
Attractiveness Jutsu, too!</i>

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:36.810
<i>Oh, stop that! If I want too badly 
to be attractive, I won't be!</i>

00:12:36.810 --> 00:12:38.740
<i>So stop thinking about it!</i>

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:41.770
<i>Oh, but I really do want it!</i>

00:12:41.770 --> 00:12:43.520
<i>This is sort of pitiful.</i>

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:45.080
Okay, next!

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:46.520
It's Itadori's turn!

00:12:46.520 --> 00:12:49.440
Okay, here goes!

00:12:49.960 --> 00:12:51.040
Sparkle!

00:12:56.640 --> 00:12:57.730
Is that...?

00:12:57.730 --> 00:12:59.790
Yes, it's Attractiveness Jutsu.

00:12:59.790 --> 00:13:01.250
"Sparkle"!

00:12:59.790 --> 00:13:02.850
We taught it to everyone before class today.

00:13:01.250 --> 00:13:04.820
It's like Azami and Tanpopo on Team Rooster!

00:13:02.850 --> 00:13:04.290
Oh, yeah?

00:13:04.820 --> 00:13:06.650
Then how about this?

00:13:08.290 --> 00:13:10.110
I wonder.

00:13:10.110 --> 00:13:11.450
That's pretty good.

00:13:11.450 --> 00:13:13.530
You try, too, Hasu!

00:13:15.520 --> 00:13:17.550
I'd be too embarrassed.

00:13:18.830 --> 00:13:20.090
That was good just now!

00:13:20.090 --> 00:13:21.720
That's Attractiveness Jutsu!

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:23.060
Huh? It is?

00:13:23.060 --> 00:13:27.580
So, this is what's popular 
with the underclassman crowd?

00:13:27.580 --> 00:13:28.040
Yeah!

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:32.760
<i>Ahh, good. Everyone's thinking 
about attractiveness together.</i>

00:13:32.760 --> 00:13:34.810
<i>I've got to do my best, too.</i>

00:13:34.810 --> 00:13:36.380
How about this, then?

00:13:36.900 --> 00:13:38.140
Hop, hop!

00:13:40.100 --> 00:13:42.640
Men sure are simple-minded, though!

00:13:42.640 --> 00:13:45.440
It only takes this to make them 
like you and let down their guard.

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:47.210
They're stupid, aren't they?

00:13:47.210 --> 00:13:49.040
You got that right!

00:13:50.860 --> 00:13:53.200
Looks like it caught on right away.

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:55.390
Of course! Because it's fun.

00:13:55.990 --> 00:14:00.710
Besides, part of why it's popular is 
that it lets you easily defeat a man.

00:14:01.530 --> 00:14:03.660
Asagao, let's go join in.

00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:07.490
Yeah! I'll show them my Attractiveness Jutsu!

00:14:07.490 --> 00:14:10.700
<i>Oh, no!</i>

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:15.030
<i>Once Sensei finds out there's a Jutsu 
going around for making fun of men...!</i>

00:14:15.030 --> 00:14:16.660
Hey, Tsubaki.

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:18.040
This is bad, isn't it?

00:14:19.320 --> 00:14:23.220
<i>When you stop and think, 
it's understandable this would happen.</i>

00:14:23.220 --> 00:14:27.920
<i>I was so worried about my own attractiveness, 
I missed something totally obvious.</i>

00:14:27.920 --> 00:14:29.100
What now?

00:14:29.520 --> 00:14:33.630
L-Let's do something... about it.

00:14:38.460 --> 00:14:40.600
Oh, are you joining in, too?

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:42.710
Attractiveness Jutsu is fun!

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:46.800
Let's be clear about this.

00:14:50.380 --> 00:14:55.120
You could never defeat a man, 
with your Jutsu at that level!

00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:56.540
Huh?

00:14:56.540 --> 00:14:57.860
Is that so?

00:14:57.860 --> 00:15:02.850
This Jutsu is profound, and you can't 
master it with a half-hearted attempt.

00:15:04.140 --> 00:15:08.700
If you use it poorly and underestimate 
a man, you'll be in trouble.

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:13.730
<i>I see now. Even if she told them not to 
make fun of men, they wouldn't listen.</i>

00:15:13.730 --> 00:15:16.290
Huh? This Jutsu is difficult?

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:18.760
Maybe it's more than we can handle.

00:15:18.760 --> 00:15:20.450
<i>Good call, Tsubaki!</i>

00:15:20.450 --> 00:15:22.280
Uh, Nee-sama.

00:15:22.280 --> 00:15:26.000
It's all right. I'm sure 
you'll get good at it, too.

00:15:26.000 --> 00:15:27.370
Don't get discouraged.

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:32.740
No, it's not about that.

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:36.600
She's right! If you try hard, 
you'll get good at it, too.

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:37.620
It's simple.

00:15:41.340 --> 00:15:44.960
<i>They kind of have the wrong idea.</i>

00:15:44.960 --> 00:15:47.730
Oh, she's just jealous!

00:15:47.730 --> 00:15:50.350
You're saying that because 
you're no good at it.

00:15:50.350 --> 00:15:51.690
That's not it!

00:15:51.690 --> 00:15:54.360
In that case, let's practice together!

00:15:54.360 --> 00:15:56.720
Yeah, I'll teach you!

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:57.780
I will, too.

00:15:57.780 --> 00:16:00.310
Hey, don't get carried away.

00:16:00.310 --> 00:16:01.350
All right, fine!

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:03.950
If that's the way it is, I'll show you.

00:16:05.870 --> 00:16:09.470
If I can do Attractiveness 
Jutsu better than you girls,

00:16:09.470 --> 00:16:13.420
will you believe that it's not 
a way to easily defeat men?

00:16:14.210 --> 00:16:15.920
Sure, I guess.

00:16:15.920 --> 00:16:16.750
Sounds good.

00:16:16.750 --> 00:16:18.340
Tsubaki, um...

00:16:18.340 --> 00:16:19.430
It's all right.

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:22.340
It's my fault things turned out like this.

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:25.330
I have to do something about it.

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:31.480
I hear that desperately wanting to be 
attractive makes you unattractive.

00:16:32.350 --> 00:16:34.850
<i>If you try too hard, 
it makes you unattractive.</i>

00:16:35.480 --> 00:16:39.080
<i>Then, yes. I just need to be relaxed.</i>

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:42.310
<i>Relaxed and natural!</i>

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:50.670
A lovely... flower!

00:16:54.440 --> 00:16:55.780
That's horrible!

00:16:55.780 --> 00:16:56.790
What was that?!

00:16:57.550 --> 00:17:00.500
<i>I can't stop from trying too hard!</i>

00:17:00.500 --> 00:17:02.270
<i>Rindou, I need backup!</i>

00:17:02.940 --> 00:17:04.220
<i>Rindou!</i>

00:17:04.220 --> 00:17:06.760
Looks like it was jealousy, after all.

00:17:06.760 --> 00:17:09.350
I don't think we need to worry about it.

00:17:09.840 --> 00:17:13.100
Nee-sama, you don't need to try so hard!

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:13.100
<i>Th-This is all wrong!</i>

00:17:13.100 --> 00:17:15.350
<i>It shouldn't be like this!</i>

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:21.620
She's right! You're cute the 
way you are, Tsubaki-chan!

00:17:22.440 --> 00:17:24.010
Flower!

00:17:24.010 --> 00:17:25.210
Flower!

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:27.230
Flower!

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:45.470
Forget it. It's not working at all.

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:49.820
To think, it's my fault 
Attractiveness Jutsu is popular.

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:03.720
Oh, are you quite sure?

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:08.900
How about this?

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:15.740
Tsubaki!

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:18.070
What?

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:21.120
Are you here to give it another shot?

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:23.690
Don't be so uptight about it.

00:18:23.690 --> 00:18:26.760
Come enjoy Attractiveness Jutsu with us...

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:36.020
What?

00:18:40.040 --> 00:18:42.070
<i>Wh-What is this?</i>

00:18:42.460 --> 00:18:45.220
<i>My face is all hot...</i>

00:18:45.890 --> 00:18:49.350
This is how Attractiveness Jutsu is done.

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:59.040
C-Can't stand up...

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:03.450
You've got to be at least 
this good to defeat a man.

00:19:07.010 --> 00:19:07.780
So, then.

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:14.860
What was <i>that</i>?

00:19:14.860 --> 00:19:16.720
It was incredible.

00:19:16.720 --> 00:19:19.170
I could never pull that off.

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:26.660
Now it's fixed.

00:19:30.260 --> 00:19:34.420
Uh, thank you very much, Sensei.

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:36.450
Mhm.

00:19:38.240 --> 00:19:40.160
I had received a report from Konoha.

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:43.440
I was watching them in secret.

00:19:45.040 --> 00:19:48.410
Tsubaki, this incident, 
apparently, started with you.

00:19:49.390 --> 00:19:50.450
Yes, ma'am...

00:19:51.200 --> 00:19:54.420
It's good that you tried 
to patch up the mess.

00:19:55.000 --> 00:19:55.740
But...

00:20:00.960 --> 00:20:04.170
Try to keep this sort of thing to a minimum.

00:20:07.530 --> 00:20:08.540
Understood?

00:20:13.320 --> 00:20:15.330
Y-Yes, ma'am...

00:20:16.760 --> 00:20:18.360
Nee-sama!

00:20:18.360 --> 00:20:20.760
What you did earlier was amazing!

00:20:20.760 --> 00:20:22.420
Please do it again!

00:20:22.420 --> 00:20:25.210
Do it! Do it!

00:20:25.690 --> 00:20:29.670
Are you listening, Nee-sama?

00:20:26.630 --> 00:20:29.670
That had to be Sensei.

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:32.880
One more time, Tsubaki-chan!

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:35.800
<i>Sensei's Attractiveness Jutsu 
was i-incredible.</i>

00:20:35.800 --> 00:22:05.810
{ED}

00:22:11.160 --> 00:22:13.040
It's called Attractiveness Jutsu.

00:22:13.040 --> 00:22:16.370
Oh, I hear that's popular 
with the underclassmen.

00:22:16.370 --> 00:22:18.110
Is it fun?

00:22:18.110 --> 00:22:19.800
It's fun!

00:22:19.800 --> 00:22:22.980
You strike weird poses, and Hinagiku cries.

00:22:23.200 --> 00:22:24.340
What do you mean?

00:22:24.340 --> 00:22:25.060
Oh!

00:22:25.060 --> 00:22:29.040
Hinagiku ends up crying 
when she sees cute things.

00:22:29.040 --> 00:22:31.200
She cries when you show her this!

00:22:31.200 --> 00:22:33.080
I can't believe how funny it is!

00:22:33.080 --> 00:22:36.480
Whoa, don't make her cry. 
I feel bad for her!

00:22:37.920 --> 00:22:40.150
Mokuren, you try doing Attractiveness Jutsu.

00:22:40.970 --> 00:22:45.730
No, thanks! It seems kind of embarrassing.

00:22:45.730 --> 00:22:47.110
Okay, then.

00:22:49.320 --> 00:22:51.390
Never mind. You could never do it.

00:22:51.390 --> 00:22:54.060
Say what?! That stuff is easy!

00:22:54.930 --> 00:22:56.570
See, look!

00:22:58.240 --> 00:23:00.380
I knew you'd be no good at it!

00:23:00.380 --> 00:23:02.190
You look so dumb!

00:23:02.190 --> 00:23:03.440
Huh?!

00:23:06.920 --> 00:23:08.720
Get back here!

00:23:08.720 --> 00:23:12.130
You little monkey!

00:23:10.050 --> 00:23:12.130
Ook! Ook! Ook!

00:23:15.430 --> 00:23:19.100
Mokuren, I'm returning the 
scrolls I was borrowing.

00:23:26.440 --> 00:23:27.810
What are you doing?

00:23:28.920 --> 00:23:30.100
Th-This is...

00:23:30.100 --> 00:23:32.310
Um, nothing at all!

00:23:33.680 --> 00:23:36.570
I-If you say so.

00:23:36.570 --> 00:23:40.060
<b>Next time:

00:23:37.080 --> 00:23:39.020
T-To be continued?
